/-!
# Requested-time whole continuous mild assembly

The requested-time replay already generates, on one actual unforced
Galerkin subsequence, its whole weak state, transverse nonlinear forcing,
every nonzero continuous mild row, the zero row, and the critical gradient
budget.  This module feeds those generated objects into the domain-generic
whole mild assembly.

The resulting `C([0,T]; ℓ²)` path is the continuous representative of the
same requested-time replay state.  It is not a caller-supplied target and
does not replace the source update by a rowwise observer.
-/

